IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `mai-core`
IMPORT `mai-seat`

-- Cases for the individual's seat (mai-seat.l4): the person injured in a motor accident, and after a death the
-- dependant, the personal representative or the funeral payer. Some cases call the core (mai-core.l4) directly, to
-- test a mapping the seat fixes (which limitation bears on which benefit, the date helpers).
-- Every expected value was worked by hand from the deposited Act (A2019-12.txt) and Declaration (NI2026-402.txt),
-- never copied from the encoding's output; the arithmetic is in the comment above each assertion. Dates were checked
-- against a calendar.
-- No scenario life raised this Act: the people are the encoder's, HYPOTHETICAL throughout.

-- Dates.
