#ASSERT `What happens if I do not reply to the WPI notice` 8 FALSE TRUE EQUALS `taken to have accepted the offer (ss 154 (4) (a), 155 (5), 156 (5))`
#ASSERT `What happens if I do not reply to the WPI notice` 12 FALSE TRUE EQUALS `taken to have accepted the offer (ss 154 (4) (a), 155 (5), 156 (5))`
#ASSERT `What happens if I do not reply to the WPI notice` 12 TRUE TRUE EQUALS `the quality of life application is finally dealt with and the entitlement ends (s 157 (6))`
#ASSERT `What happens if I do not reply to the WPI notice` 3 FALSE FALSE EQUALS `taken to have accepted each report (s 154 (4) (b))`
#ASSERT `What happens if I do not reply to the WPI notice` 3 FALSE TRUE EQUALS `taken to have accepted the offer (ss 154 (4) (a), 155 (5), 156 (5))`

