-- =====================================================================================================================
-- Date helpers of the core (calendar-checked).
-- =====================================================================================================================

`29 Feb 2028` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 29 2 2028
`28 Feb 2030` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 28 2 2030
`31 Aug 2026` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2026
`28 Feb 2031` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 28 2 2031
`3 Feb 2031`  MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 3 2 2031

-- 29 February 2028 plus 2 years is 28 February 2030 (a reading): a late application after an accident on 29 February
-- 2028 may be accepted until 28 February 2030.
#ASSERT `What is the last day for a late application` `IRB` `29 Feb 2028` `29 Feb 2028` EQUALS `28 Feb 2030`
-- 4 years and 6 months after 3 August 2026 is 3 February 2031; after 31 August 2026, 28 February 2031.
#ASSERT `4 years and 6 months after` `3 Aug 2026` EQUALS `3 Feb 2031`
#ASSERT `4 years and 6 months after` `31 Aug 2026` EQUALS `28 Feb 2031`
-- Weekends: 10 October 2026 is a Saturday; 1 October 2026 a Thursday.
#ASSERT `falls on a weekend` `10 Oct 2026`
#ASSERT NOT (`falls on a weekend` `1 Oct 2026`)
